# Player Feedback & Improvements (from 11/21 survey)
## Level 1 UX & Accessibility
- [ ] Add ability to recall/reopen tutorial during gameplay (F2 or menu option)
- [ ] Make settings/keybindings more visible and descriptive in F1 panel
- [ ] Consider longer tutorial with option to close and reopen

## Level 1 Gameplay Balance
- [ ] Rebalance enemy spawning - reduce enemy count or spawn rate in early game
- [ ] Improve "surrounded by enemies" scenario - add dodge/block ability or escape mechanic
- [ ] Consider additional punishment for poor positioning rather than instant death

## Level 1 Content & Progression
- [ ] Implement weapon progression system - unlock new weapons after defeating X enemies
- [ ] Implement rock mining mechanic with rock-based/iron ore weapons (superior to branches)
- [ ] Expand weapon variety beyond branches and arrows
- [ ] Add more varied enemy types for Level 1

## Positive Feedback to Maintain
- Branch throwing mechanic (well-received)
- Farming/crafting system for survival
- Gold coin drop RNG rewards
- Mode adjustment function

